"Project-Id-Version: GNOME Gnumeric help\n"
"Language: sv\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2337
msgid ""
"These entries allow user to convert data already in a worksheet or to import"
" external data directly into a worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Med de här menyobjekten kan du omvandla data som redan finns i ett "
"kalkylblad eller importera externa data direkt till ett kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2345
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Text to Columns...</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Text to "
"Columns...</guimenuitem> menu item opens a dialog box through which a user "
"can create derived information based on data in other worksheets."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Text till kolumner…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Text till kolumner…</guimenuitem> öppnar en dialogruta där du "
"kan skapa härledd information från data i andra kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2354
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Import Data</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Import "
"Data</guimenuitem> menu item provides the following submenu:"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Importera data</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Importera data</guimenuitem> öppnar följande undermeny:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2362
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-data-import.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the Import Data "
"submenu.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-data-import.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av undermenyn Importera "
"data.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2372
msgid ""
"The items in this submenu allow the user to import data from various non-"
"spreadsheet formats. To open files in a spreadsheet format, use the "
"<guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem> menu described in <xref linkend=\"File-"
"Menu\"/>. See <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/> for details. These "
"submenu items create a new window containing the selected file. A more "
"extensive discussion is presented in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-open\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Med menyobjekten i undermenyn kan du importera data från olika format som "
"inte är kalkylbladsformat. Om du vill öppna filer i kalkylbladsformat "
"använder du menyn <guimenuitem>Öppna</guimenuitem>, som beskrivs i <xref "
"linkend=\"File-Menu\"/>. Mer information finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"formats\"/>. De här menyobjekten öppnar den valda filen i ett nytt fönster. "
"En utförligare beskrivning finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-open\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2387
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Export Data</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Export "
"Data</guimenuitem> menu item provides the following submenu:"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Exportera data</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Exportera data</guimenuitem> öppnar följande undermeny:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2395
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-data-export.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the Export Data "
"submenu.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-data-export.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av undermenyn Exportera "
"data.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2405
msgid ""
"The items in this submenu allows users to export the current file or sheet "
"to a non-spreadsheet format. The <guimenuitem>Repeat Export</guimenuitem> "
"menu item repeats the last export in the current session or, if the file was"
" recently imported, exports the file to the original source. To save data "
"from <application>Gnumeric</application> in a spreadsheet format, use the "
"<guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem> menu described in <xref "
"linkend=\"File-Menu\"/>. For an explanation of the file formats which "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> supports see <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"save\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Med menyobjekten i undermenyn kan du exportera den aktuella filen eller det "
"aktuella kalkylbladet till ett annat format än kalkylbladsformat. "
"<guimenuitem>Upprepa export</guimenuitem> upprepar den senaste exporten "
"under den aktuella sessionen. Om filen nyligen importerades exporteras den i"
" stället till sitt ursprungliga format. Om du vill spara data från "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> i ett kalkylbladsformat använder du "
"menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Spara som…</guimenuitem> (se <xref linkend=\"File-"
"Menu\"/>). Mer information om filformaten för "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"save\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2444
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-help-labelled.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the Help menu.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-help-labelled.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av menyn Hjälp.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2455
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu connects users to this manual, to the list "
"of functions available for use in <application>Gnumeric</application> and to"
" the list of people who created this wonderful application."
msgstr ""
"Menyn <guimenu>Hjälp</guimenu> länkar till handboken, listan över "
"tillgängliga funktioner i <application>Gnumeric</application> och listan "
"över programmets upphovspersoner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2467
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> Entries to find help and report a "
"problem with <application>Gnumeric</application>"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> Alternativ för att hitta hjälp och "
"rapportera problem med <application>Gnumeric</application>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2473
msgid ""
"These menu items allow the user to obtain help from several sources or to "
"report a problem with the program."
msgstr ""
"Med de här menyobjekten kan du få hjälp från flera källor eller rapportera "
"ett problem med programmet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2481
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Contents</guimenuitem> — This menu entry allows the user to "
"launch the local help system and display this manual."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Innehåll</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet öppnar det lokala "
"hjälpsystemet och visar den här handboken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2489
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem><application>Gnumeric</application> on the Web</guimenuitem> — "
"This menu entry allows the user to launch a web browser and explore the web "
"site dedicated to <application>Gnumeric</application> on the server used by "
"the GNOME project."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem><application>Gnumeric</application> på webben</guimenuitem> — "
"Menyobjektet öppnar en webbläsare och visar webbplatsen för "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> på GNOME-projektets server."
